SUMMARY:FRAUDS / giftig (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Chelsea
DESCRIPTION:Doors: 20:00\, Start: 20:15   FRAUDS are a South London (Croydon) two-piece who've been tearing through alt-rock since 2012. Across a series of self-produced EPs and albums released through British indie label Alcopop!\, they've carved out a sound that swings between punk\, garage rock\, and razor- sharp sarcasm—distinctly\, defiantly British. Playful but punishing\, Frauds built a devoted cult following on the UK circuit\, sharing stages with IDLES\, Mclusky\, Future Of The Left\, Ditz\, JOHN\, and USA Nails.  www.instagram.com/fraudsband/?hl=de https://linktr.ee/fraudsfraudsfrauds    giftig The musical antidote to a toxic world. Born out of friendship and growing into a band by way of a few detours\, the five-piece from Vienna turns pent-up anger\, world-weariness and toxic experiences into fast\, direct garage punk songs with melody. Their songs combine raw energy\, emotional honesty and sweaty live dynamics. Moving between longing\, empowerment\, loss of control and chaos\, giftig sit somewhere between arasive punk\, dirty garage sounds and melancholic moments\, without ever losing their directness. www.instagram.com/giftigband/
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6623
END:VEVENT
